    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37531" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξομῑλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have intercourse, live with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					11.4
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>bear</i> one <i>company,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφάνων οὐ μία χροιὰ . . τάχ᾽
					ἐξομιλήσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					518
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλανθρώπως ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cim.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>win over, conciliate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					7.4.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.824d
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>to be away from one's friends, be alone in the
				crowd,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				735
			</span></i>.</div>
